        "subject": "LU-16518 socklnd: remove unused variable",
        "message": "LU-16518 socklnd: remove unused variable\n\nThe 'ipaddr' variable in ksocknal_startup() is set but never\nused, which triggers a -Wunused-but-set-variable warning.\nRemove it.\n\nFixes: 2e49bc7dd170 (\"LU-18812 lnet: restrict IP addresses that socklnd listens on\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Iaaff7b504ef23be002ff358648669ec4b6f22c7e\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/67348\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Chris Horn <chorn@ddn.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: James Simmons <jsimmons@infradead.org>\n"
